    38→
    39→```bash
    40→git clone --branch base repo_bundles/jingmo-for-harmonyos-b2e40f69dd-base.bundle ../harmonycup-work/jm-spec7
    41→git -C ../harmonycup-work/jm-spec7 checkout --detach b2e40f69dde450852d977c9555a9b12d59508c0d
    42→```
